WEBVTT

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:02.800
Apologies for the wait.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:04.490
Here are your octopus balls.

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.530
Is something wrong?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.860
It's got octopus in it!

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.440
Well, they're <i>octopus</i> balls.

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:19.220
I hate octopus.

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:20.930
Make 'em without it.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:21.790
What?!

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:23.550
Just give up.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.210
You know full well how selfish that kid can get.

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:30.610
Even then, she's goin' pretty overkill.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.400
I mean, get a load of what she did to the princess's room!

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.990
Talk about poor taste.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:38.140
And you stooges are ones to talk?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:40.360
You keep getting whooped by the Precures,

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:43.960
and you've gotten nowhere near enough Egogy to bring Daddy back.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:45.930
Fair point,

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.960
but the Precures have one of the three Sacred Treasures,

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:54.010
the Magical Lovely Pad, and have grown considerably stronger.

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.580
Three Sacred Treasures?

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:58.640
Then how about you guys nab a few?

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.850
Three minus one equals two, right?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:03.910
True...

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:08.390
Deep within this palace lies Princess Ann's spear of light,

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.450
the Miracle Dragon Glaive.

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:12.820
There ya go!

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.150
We Selfishes can't pull it out.

00:01:15.800 --> 00:01:18.280
It's got some kinda magic lock on it.

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:24.340
Which is why we've been searching for the princess to undo it.

00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:25.190
Understand?

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:27.170
Oh, I understand...

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.720
just how incompetent you stooges are!

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.110
What'd you say?!

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:36.180
<i>Regina's reawakening means that our time is up.</i>

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:41.360
<i>All we can do is take a do-or-die gamble on that spear of light...</i>

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:42.020
{OP}

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:48.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:50.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:53.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:53.860 --> 00:01:55.590
Every day it sparkles

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.260
Dokidoki Precure

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:06.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:11.850
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:17.500
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:02:18.020 --> 00:02:22.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:28.630
If your friends are in trouble

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:37.520
isn't it normal to help them?

00:02:37.520 --> 00:02:39.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:44.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:47.210
What's more than just cute

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:51.090
is our promise between girls

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:57.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:03.030
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:08.770
Solitaire

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:12.740
What are you doing?

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:16.040
Don't you think we've gotten stronger?

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:16.950
Wanna test that?

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:27.120
It is true that we've mastered the Magical Lovely Pad.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:32.360
I believe it may be time for our final confrontation with King Selfish. {Not when we've got ten episodes left.}

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:34.920
I'll finally see Regina again!

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:37.390
I'll finally take back Trump Kingdom!

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.620
Finally!

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:42.770
So, how do we get there?

00:03:43.770 --> 00:03:46.110
This calls for a strategy meet!

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:47.310
Agreed!

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:50.520
Let's share our wisdom over a hot cup of tea!

00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:56.760
M-Mister!

00:03:58.030 --> 00:03:59.090
Hey.

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:07.890
We're Here to See You!

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:07.890
We're Here to See You!

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.090
What made you come back?

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:13.300
How is the princess?

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.270
Did you know that Ai came back?

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:21.240
Now, let's calm down. I'll answer one at a time.

00:04:21.230 --> 00:04:24.330
Before you do, we'd like to introduce you to someone.

00:04:25.010 --> 00:04:27.080
My name is Madoka Aguri.

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.550
I'm Joe Okada.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.760
It's a pleasure to meet you, Miss Cure Ace.

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:35.020
You know?

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:36.230
I've heard a few things.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.950
And I've heard much about you.

00:04:40.950 --> 00:04:43.830
As well as your fiancée, Princess Ann.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:44.700
Right!

00:04:45.190 --> 00:04:48.160
I returned for one reason alone.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:50.370
It's about the princess!

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.180
What about her?

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:58.440
I tried everything I could,

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.150
but the princess showed no signs of awakening.

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:07.970
But while searching for another way, I found an answer.

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:08.620
It was...

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:09.820
What was it?

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:16.390
One of the three Sacred Treasures obtained by the legendary Precure warriors,

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.240
the Miracle Dragon Glaive.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.800
Miracle Dragon Glaive...

00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:22.850
That's the spear the princess used!

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:27.580
The spear of light that could pierce any obstacle.

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:30.890
It could certainly break the princess's seal!

00:05:31.350 --> 00:05:34.080
We can awaken the princess with the spear's power?

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:36.630
Now, one moment.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:40.150
Where is the princess's spear, anyway?

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.790
Underneath the Trump Palace.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.170
In Trump Kingdom...

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:46.900
So much for that.

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:50.190
Since we've got no way to get there and all.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:51.990
Not to worry!

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.740
I can take us there via teleportation!

00:05:55.730 --> 00:05:58.780
Wait, you can teleport?

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:01.060
Well, I, uh...

00:06:01.850 --> 00:06:04.180
I've been training, yeah!

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:08.220
It's not like I did nothing all day with Princess Ann, right?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.790
What should we do?

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:14.250
We've gotta go to Trump Kingdom!

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.720
That's where we wanted to go this whole time.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:20.190
One can't catch a lion without entering the lion's den, as they say.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:24.750
I'm hungry.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:27.830
Well, let's get some food in us before heading out.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.960
We can't fight on an empty stomach!

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.680
Oh, in that case,

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:33.650
I have just the thing.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:37.640
Why octopus balls?

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.820
I happened to make too much.

00:06:40.140 --> 00:06:41.820
Don't mind if we do!

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:42.780
I'll help myself as well.

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:47.290
It's so yummy!

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:53.700
The spice of the ginger and flavor of the bonito within the rich scent of the breading is...

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:00.400
These octopus balls...

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.070
don't have any octopus!

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:06.740
Well, you see...

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:07.770
Faker...

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:12.100
An octopus ball with no octopus...

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:14.650
is just a faker!

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:20.000
Oh... how silly of me to forget to put those in!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.840
We got here in an instant!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:31.240
So this is Trump Kingdom...

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.510
Oh, it's your first time here, Aguri.

00:07:34.860 --> 00:07:35.690
Yes...

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.900
But I wonder...

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:46.780
why does this breeze that brushes my cheek feel so familiar?

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:50.890
The palace is that-a-way!

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:56.800
We're right in plain sight!

00:07:56.800 --> 00:07:58.730
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:07:58.730 --> 00:08:03.630
If we take this sewer, we'll reach the temple without drawing any attention.

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:07.520
But the sewers are labyrinthine!

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:08.970
We can't afford to get lost.

00:08:11.180 --> 00:08:12.320
Ai?

00:08:15.200 --> 00:08:16.510
Is that...

00:08:16.840 --> 00:08:19.530
A map of the sewer system?

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:25.620
And is that blinking dot the location of the spear of light?

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.400
I see. It makes sense for the three Sacred Treasures to call to one another.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:33.150
Wh-What?

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:34.310
Oh, nothing.

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.230
Nothing at all.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:38.830
L-Let's get a move-on!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.470
Girls, that's it!

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:17.110
This is the Miracle Dragon Glaive?

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:20.180
Yes, this is definitely the princess's spear!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.450
<i>If I can get my hands on this, I'll be Numero Uno...</i>

00:09:25.450 --> 00:09:27.760
<i>Now, just pull it...</i>

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:29.150
Huh?

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:34.070
Wh-What's the matter?

00:09:34.070 --> 00:09:35.390
C'mon, take the sp—

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.240
Before we do,

00:09:37.240 --> 00:09:39.890
you should drop the act already,

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:40.870
Bel!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.250
When did you figure me out?

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.730
You were fishy from the start!

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:11.120
<i>I returned for one reason alone.</i>

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.430
<i>It's about the princess!</i>

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:17.230
You just called her "the princess"! {I'm going to pretend nobody mentioned anything about honorifics here}

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:22.210
Jonathan calls her "Ann" with love!

00:10:22.770 --> 00:10:26.700
And that teleportation thing was a dead giveaway!

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:27.410
Not to mention...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:30.180
The color on your apron is way off!

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:32.940
That scarf looks just like Bel's!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:35.710
That settles it!

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:39.420
Just like those octopus balls with no octopus...

00:10:40.980 --> 00:10:44.090
You're a faker!

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:04.310
If you knew, then why did you come this far?

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.280
Why else?

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:08.720
To give King Selfish...

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:10.680
To give King Selfish what?

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:13.650
a stern talking-to!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.790
T-Talking?!

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.560
We'll tell him to leave Trump Kingdom

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:21.840
and return the Selfish-turned citizens back to normal!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:22.760
And then...

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.700
we'll make him swear to never harm Regina again!

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:31.400
Th-That's madness!

00:11:31.400 --> 00:11:36.660
King Selfish has no reason to listen to the likes of you!

00:11:36.660 --> 00:11:38.180
Does he, now?

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:44.920
One of the Sacred Treasures, the Magical Lovely Pad, has already made us much stronger.

00:11:45.580 --> 00:11:50.290
And now we have another Sacred Treasure, the princess's spear!

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:56.930
And it's all thanks to you for leading us right to it!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:12:01.760
Thank you ever so much!

00:12:05.710 --> 00:12:06.850
Not yet...

00:12:06.850 --> 00:12:10.080
That spear isn't yours just yet!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.660
Selfish!

00:12:11.660 --> 00:12:12.950
You rang?!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.850
Fish, fish...

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:18.050
Octopecs!

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:20.120
Girls, let's go!

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:23.000
Charles!

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:26.830
Precure Love Link!

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:27.610
L-O-V-E!

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:28.290
L-O-V-E!

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:29.030
L-O-V-E!

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.020
L-O-V-E!

00:12:31.290 --> 00:12:34.040
Precure Dress Up!

00:12:34.280 --> 00:12:36.230
Kyupirappa!

00:12:55.730 --> 00:12:57.180
Brimming with love,

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.280
Cure Heart!

00:13:02.010 --> 00:13:03.420
The light of wisdom,

00:13:04.470 --> 00:13:05.940
Cure Diamond!

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:09.950
The warmth of the sun,

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:12.350
Cure Rosetta!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.090
The blade of courage,

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.030
Cure Sword!

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.850
Love's trump card,

00:13:21.850 --> 00:13:23.400
Cure Ace!

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.330
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:30.090
Dokidoki Precure!

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:33.700
Oh poor octopus who has lost his love,

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:35.870
I, Cure Heart,

00:13:35.860 --> 00:13:38.980
will make your heart race once more!

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.240
Have an Octopunch!

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.860
I shall handle this Selfish.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:49.480
You obtain the spear of light!

00:13:51.440 --> 00:13:52.710
Gotcha!

00:13:54.210 --> 00:13:57.650
I'll snatch that spear the moment you pull it out!

00:13:58.090 --> 00:13:59.620
Seeelf!

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:01.660
Selfish!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:04.750
Girls!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:06.380
Selfish!

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:09.170
You ruined it!

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:11.700
Don't attack them until they draw the spear!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:12.360
Self.

00:14:13.570 --> 00:14:16.110
Good, the spear's safe!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.640
Yes, pull it out!

00:14:24.680 --> 00:14:26.480
I'll help you, Cure Heart!

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:28.980
Us too!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:32.610
No good.

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.090
It's not budging.

00:14:35.280 --> 00:14:36.300
What's this?

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:38.990
Not even the Precures can draw it?

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:41.680
Self...

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:45.280
Selfish!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:48.150
You really <i>are</i> incompetent.

00:14:57.180 --> 00:15:00.080
P-Princess Regina, why are you here?

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.650
Something here was making me nauseous, so I came to see what.

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:09.560
I had a feeling it was you.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.030
I haven't forgotten the disgrace you made me s—

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.400
Regina!

00:15:21.890 --> 00:15:22.570
Regina!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:25.250
It's really you!

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:28.090
How've you been?

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:29.540
Have you been eating well?

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:34.610
I couldn't stop worrying about you!

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:38.960
I never asked you to.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.720
I know the truth now.

00:15:42.720 --> 00:15:47.090
The only one in the world who truly cares about me is Daddy.

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:50.590
Daddy's the only one I need!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.040
That's not true!

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:56.510
Heart cares about you more than you can imagine! {I'm not writing "Heart cares about you from the bottom of her heart" nope.}

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:00.010
We all feel the same way.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:04.050
Regina, let's talk this out again.

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:07.410
I know we'll see eye to eye!

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:07.780
Okay?

00:16:10.620 --> 00:16:11.760
Geez...

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:14.390
All you ever do is nag, nag, nag, nag, nag!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.700
Cure Heart!

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.690
Don't worry.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:25.550
Why?

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.050
Why are you unharmed?

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:30.630
Because we've grown stronger. {Seriously, it's like the story just decided "oh yeah, they're stronger now" when all they did was get an iPad.}

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:33.110
All so you could listen to us.

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:35.710
Don't make me laugh!

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:41.880
We came all this way!

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:45.020
We've fought, we've grown,

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.090
and now we're standing by your side!

00:16:49.810 --> 00:16:52.330
Come with us, Regina!

00:16:52.840 --> 00:16:54.030
Let's try one more time...

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:55.730
to recover your love!

00:16:55.730 --> 00:16:56.860
Regina!

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:58.200
Regina!

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.360
Regina!

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:03.940
This is bad.

00:17:03.940 --> 00:17:07.650
If the spear <i>and</i> Regina fall into the enemy's hands,

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:09.290
it'll be my head!

00:17:10.850 --> 00:17:13.870
Love love loooove!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:15.320
My Selfish, too?!

00:17:18.580 --> 00:17:19.520
Shut up...

00:17:21.410 --> 00:17:25.730
You're just doing this to hurt me again, aren't you?

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:29.560
You can take your love and friendship and shove it!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.230
Regina?

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:36.230
I'm happiest when I'm with Daddy.

00:17:36.990 --> 00:17:38.640
When Daddy holds me in his arms,

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.340
nothing bad can hurt me!

00:17:43.210 --> 00:17:47.320
So stop trying to ruin our lives!

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:52.640
Regina!

00:17:57.150 --> 00:17:59.160
I'm getting pumped with power!

00:18:03.740 --> 00:18:05.310
Here it comes!

00:18:11.840 --> 00:18:13.330
What happened?

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:14.240
It's Egogy!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:19.210
The Egogy flowing from Regina's body is powering the Selfish up!

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:21.420
Calm down, Regina!

00:18:21.410 --> 00:18:24.120
You can't give in to hatred!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:26.080
I told you to shut up...

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:29.150
The Precures are my enemies...

00:18:29.150 --> 00:18:31.830
They're enemies who hurt Daddy!

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.300
Selfish!

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:38.290
Focus on the Selfish!

00:18:40.010 --> 00:18:41.940
Magical Lovely Pad!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:52.250
Gather!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.120
Heart Dynamite!

00:19:00.230 --> 00:19:02.090
Head over heels...

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:18.270
We send our power to you, Cure Heart!

00:19:27.890 --> 00:19:31.890
Precure Lovely Straight Flush!

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:43.650
Love love looooove!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.900
You still don't understand?

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:57.170
No matter how strongly you reject and despise her,

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:59.650
Cure Heart will continue to care for you.

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:03.020
That is her form of love.

00:20:04.590 --> 00:20:06.220
I don't care.

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.290
Daddy has nobody but me...

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.280
If he lost me,

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:13.510
he'd be all alone...

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:20.470
So I'll protect Daddy no matter what!

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:31.380
The spear!

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:35.350
How could Regina draw the spear when even the Precures couldn't?!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:39.180
Could the spear have chosen Regina?

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:42.720
The Precures are Daddy's enemies.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:43.400
Which means...

00:20:44.430 --> 00:20:46.830
the Precures are nuisances!

00:20:47.940 --> 00:20:48.700
Regina!

00:20:49.090 --> 00:20:52.870
I'll eliminate Daddy's enemies!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:56.640
Begone, Precures!

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.680
This is the strength of the Miracle Dragon Glaive...

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.510
Cute trick!

00:21:05.510 --> 00:21:08.150
But can you hold out?

00:21:10.850 --> 00:21:13.550
My apologies, but I can't contain any more!

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:15.550
I won't give in...

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:18.140
Until my feelings reach your heart...

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.030
I'll stay standing, Regina!

00:21:25.530 --> 00:21:26.620
What?

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:27.730
It's a mirror?

00:21:35.430 --> 00:21:36.640
Isn't that Oogai City?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.840
We can see our city!

00:21:46.220 --> 00:21:48.400
Th-They disappeared!

00:21:48.400 --> 00:21:50.980
Was that the power of the Lovely Pad?

00:21:50.980 --> 00:21:53.370
Aww, they ran away.

00:21:53.690 --> 00:21:57.380
But they won't be so lucky next time.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:59.570
Get ready, Precures...

00:22:05.040 --> 00:22:05.070
{ED}

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:10.340
What's wrong with Makopi?

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:12.880
She seems to be writing a new song.

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:15.780
I hope it's a song that will touch Regina's heart.

00:22:15.780 --> 00:22:17.920
If anyone can make it, it's Makopi!

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:21.250
But that's the part that seems to be troubling her...

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:25.220
Then let's all help Makopi write her new song!

00:22:25.220 --> 00:22:26.120
Yeah!

00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:28.360
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:31.660
Getting Our Feelings Across!

00:22:28.360 --> 00:22:31.660
Getting Our Feelings Across!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:33.600
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
